\title{Plonk and Halo2}
\author{dhsorens}
\date{2026-08-18}

\p{
    The system that made [Plonkish](dhsorens-002T) a category, and the implementation that most
    auditors' intuitions were formed on.
}

\p{
    Questions this page should answer:
    \ul{
        \li{The protocol: gate identity, permutation argument, quotient, and opening.}
        \li{Universal and updatable setup, and what it removed as an operational problem.}
        \li{Halo2's departures: the table and region model, and the commitment swap from KZG to IPA
        in some deployments.}
        \li{Where the lookup argument entered, and how it changed circuit design practice.}
        \li{ArkLib's \code{ProofSystem/Plonk} and \code{ConstraintSystem/Plonk.lean}: which layer
        each covers.}
    }
}
